## Approach

- `NavigationMixin` is applied to the class, so navigation always goes through `this[NavigationMixin.Navigate]` (page references, never hand-built URLs) and link generation through `this[NavigationMixin.GenerateUrl]`.
- The three buttons are native `<button>` elements that carry `data-action`; a single click handler reads the action from `event.currentTarget.dataset.action` (no manual URL construction anywhere).
- The `My_Open_Cases` list-view link is produced with `GenerateUrl` (a promise) and only rendered once resolved, so the `<a class="cases-link">` never renders with an empty `href`.
- `encodeDefaultFieldValues` from `lightning/pageReferenceUtils` produces the `state.defaultFieldValues` for the prefilled New Contact page.

